o smash, freeze, burn the creatures of nightmare, only to mention a few ways that can turn them into tiny, bloody pieces. <br></li><li><strong>\tRewards of curiosity:</strong> Find the hidden corners on the maps and hunt down the neutral creatures hiding away from the battle for exclusive loot; you can also solve rewarding side quests as well.<br></li><li><strong>\tBecome one of the specialists:</strong> Choose from 3 diverse classes (Mercenary, Sorceress, and Marksman); each class offers different tactics, skills and powers to dispose your enemies.<br></li><li><strong>\tWith experience comes wisdom – and brand new ways to deal with those annoying invaders: </strong>The extended and detailed character development offers you 100 levels to achieve and more than 50 Skills per class.<br></li><li><strong>\tWeapons of destruction have never been so much fun:</strong> fend off the invaders with 25 deadly traps and more than 150 trap upgrades, not to mention the very special upgrades, which are tied to challenging and fun achievements.<br></li><li><strong>\tEnter a truly grim fantasy netherworld: </strong>the Ink, the mysterious otherworld in the Incredible Adventures of Van Helsing games has hidden regions and ancient secrets; now can face what is waiting in those depths.<br></li><li><strong>\tGear up and stand your ground: </strong>The detailed equipment mechanics and the comprehensive loot system make your inventory highly customizable.<br></li><li><strong>\tA wide variety of horrors to defeat:</strong> Invaders come in 3 races and more than 40 different types; the countless combination of monster abilities will make the invading swarms even more colorful. <br></li><li><strong>\tMake your legendary weapons even more effective: </strong>Artifact crafting gives you new ways to experiment with lethal magical items.<br></li><li><strong>\tKing of the Maze:</strong> The leaderboards and the rank system lets you compete with other players.</li></ul>",
