                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I came from Diablo 2 and played through Diablo 4 campaign. Having fun with ARPGs again I got myself into Grim Dawn. Many hours into it I thought that Id take a small break and hop into some tower defence game for a change. Looking around for some TD title I didnt own yet, I stumbled over this. Sceptical at first, I have to admit that its a fun, fun blend. It feels a bit slow at the beginning but thats necessary for the overall pace of the gane which is also a TD where you need to build and maintain towers. It looks ok imo. Sound is great. Game loop is fun due to the ARPG-ish progression that extendt to towers, too. Definitively a recommend if you like both genres and never thought you need a game with both blended together.",
